sequenceDiagram
  actor User as 用户
  participant Web as 检索页面
  participant API as M05 API
  participant Auth as M01权限
  participant DB as PostgreSQL PostGIS
  User->>Web: 设置类型 场所 时间 目标
  Web->>API: POST /captures/search 请求体
  API->>Auth: 检查操作权限及场所范围
  Auth-->>API: 允许的范围
  API->>DB: 参数化索引检索 + 游标
  DB-->>API: 限量记录
  API-->>Web: 脱敏 items nextCursor traceId
  User->>Web: 选择记录并点轨迹
  Web->>API: POST /contexts
  API->>Auth: 重校目标与范围
  API-->>Web: contextId
  Web->>Web: 导航地图研判，仅传 contextId
